WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.055 --> 00:00:06.102
Ben: I'm glad we met at the playground.

2
00:00:06.103 --> 00:00:10.973
Theo: Frankie likes the slide!

3
00:00:10.974 --> 00:00:21.340
Riley: Snooks is climbing up the wrong way! No, Snooks!

4
00:00:21.341 --> 00:00:23.225
Skyler: Here comes Sarah.

5
00:00:23.226 --> 00:00:25.938
And she's running!

6
00:00:25.939 --> 00:00:27.767
Sarah: Guess what!

7
00:00:27.768 --> 00:00:29.978
Riley: What?

8
00:00:29.979 --> 00:00:33.416
Sarah: There's a magic show today in the park.

9
00:00:33.417 --> 00:00:36.457
And my mom will take us!

10
00:00:36.458 --> 00:00:39.862
Skyler: I love magic shows!

11
00:00:39.863 --> 00:00:42.354
Theo: I have a magic

12
00:00:42.355 --> 00:00:45.274
kit. I tried to make Whiskers

13
00:00:45.275 --> 00:00:48.196
disappear. But it didn't work.

14
00:00:48.197 --> 00:00:57.006
Riley: That's okay. Whiskers disappears all the time anyway.

15
00:00:57.007 --> 00:01:00.771
Sarah: We're going to see a real magician.

16
00:01:00.772 --> 00:01:03.098
Skyler: Can he cut people in half?

17
00:01:03.099 --> 00:01:06.693
I saw a magician do that once.

18
00:01:06.694 --> 00:01:10.967
Sarah: He cut someone in half?

19
00:01:10.968 --> 00:01:12.625
Skyler: Well, not really.

20
00:01:12.625 --> 00:01:15.210
It was just a trick.

21
00:01:15.211 --> 00:01:18.406
Riley: I'll go ask my mom if I can go.

22
00:01:18.407 --> 00:01:20.490
Theo, Ben, and Skyler: Me too.

23
00:01:20.491 --> 00:01:29.159
Riley: See you later, Sarah!

24
00:01:29.160 --> 00:01:33.227
Ben: We're lucky. We got front row seats!

25
00:01:33.228 --> 00:01:37.316
Skyler: The show is starting!

26
00:01:37.317 --> 00:01:40.742
Magician: Good afternoon, everyone!

27
00:01:40.743 --> 00:01:45.880
I am going to do a very special trick.

28
00:01:45.881 --> 00:01:48.744
I will need someone to help me.

29
00:01:48.745 --> 00:01:51.792
Who wants to come up on stage?

30
00:01:51.793 --> 00:01:55.962
Kids: Me, me, me!

31
00:01:55.963 --> 00:02:01.844
Magician: The little girl in the front row.

32
00:02:01.845 --> 00:02:04.557
Sarah: Who, me?

33
00:02:04.558 --> 00:02:07.756
Magician: Yes, step right up!

34
00:02:07.757 --> 00:02:09.534
Riley: Go on, Sarah.

35
00:02:09.535 --> 00:02:13.294
It will be fun!

36
00:02:13.295 --> 00:02:16.024
Sarah: Can I bring my cat, Mittens?

37
00:02:16.025 --> 00:02:24.939
Magician: Yes. I will do a daring trick with Mittens!

